==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 36.67~43.33 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,300f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*2 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Hackey]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
**6 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**2 [[Ragin' Gory|Ragin' Gories]] spawn, delay 43.33~50 seconds<sup>1,300f~1,500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring a solid anti-Dark unit here so you don't get overwhelmed by Gory spam. This is one of the best stages to bring [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Heavy Assault C.A.T.]] into if you haven't already used it. Hackey poses very little threat if you stay on top of the Gory spam.

